====== TP-Link TL-WR743ND ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

TL-WR743ND is a low cost (40€) b/g/n 150 Mb/s wireless router, capable of running OpenWrt. Hardware is the same as TL-WR741ND with PoE capability on WAN port.


